        "statement": "Any drug, biologic or medical device product for which we receive FDA marketing authorization will be subject to continuing regulation by the FDA, including, among other things, record keeping requirements, reporting of adverse events, providing FDA with updated safety and efficacy information, filing changes to manufacturing process and analytical testing, product sampling and distribution requirements (for drugs and biologics), restrictions on advertising and promotion, and FDA inspections.",
