        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In March 2025, we completed the sale of the Baltimore-Bayview drug substance manufacturing facility to Syngene for approximately $36.5 million at closing, while retaining the right to secure manufacturing services and capacity at the facility for future growth and pandemic response production in collaboration with Syngene.",
