        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commitment to attracting, developing, and retaining talented employees helps us to fuel our business growth, drive innovation in the products and services we develop, and inform the way we solve problems and how we serve the needs of a global and diverse patient, customer and partner base.",
