        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2016, we signed a combination development and procurement contract with Biomedical Advanced Research and Development Authority (\"BARDA\"), which included a five-year base period of performance to develop CYFENDUS® for post-exposure prophylaxis of anthrax disease and to deliver to the SNS an initial two million doses, subsequently modified to three million doses in March 2017.",
